From: Armada contributors <noreply@armada-os.org>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qcom: sc8280xp: configure the Eliza MI2S ports

The Retroid Pocket Duo (Eliza) has two AW88166 speaker amps on primary
MI2S and an ES8326 headset codec on quaternary MI2S. Both need the MI2S
port's MCLK and BCLK, I2S consumer format on the codecs, and the codec
sysclk; the ES8326 also detects the jack itself.

armada (armada-os/armada b91b786) does this with its own hw_params in
1175 (from RetroidPocket/linux 592a27a5a037) and hands the jack to the
codec by adding the quaternary MI2S ids to qcom_snd_wcd_jack_setup()
(1174). Here the same is expressed in this tree's per-DAI data
(as for the MANGMI Air X): mclk/bclk/codec sysclk on PRIMARY_MI2S_RX,
QUATERNARY_MI2S_RX and QUATERNARY_MI2S_TX, codec format BC_FC | NB_NF |
I2S, and the generic codec jack helper (`0861`) on QUATERNARY_MI2S_RX.
Codec DMA ports keep the WCD jack, as mainline's eliza card had it.

MCLK is rate * 256 and BCLK rate * channels * width, as armada's. Not
run on hardware.
---
 sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c | 27 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 27 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c b/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
index d71aa7b30..53e85df94 100644
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
@@ -567,11 +567,38 @@ static const struct qcom_snd_soc_common mangmi_air_x_priv_data = {
 	),
 };
 
+/*
+ * Eliza. The Retroid Pocket Duo has two AW88166 speaker amps on primary
+ * MI2S and an ES8326 on quaternary MI2S that detects the headset jack
+ * itself; both are clocked by the MI2S port. Codec DMA ports keep the
+ * WCD jack.
+ */
 static const struct qcom_snd_soc_common eliza_priv_data = {
 	.driver_name = "eliza",
 	.dapm_widgets = sc8280xp_dapm_widgets,
 	.num_dapm_widgets = ARRAY_SIZE(sc8280xp_dapm_widgets),
 	.wcd_jack = true,
+	.codec_dai_fmt = SND_SOC_DAIFMT_BC_FC |
+			 SND_SOC_DAIFMT_NB_NF |
+			 SND_SOC_DAIFMT_I2S,
+	SC8280XP_DAI_DATA({
+			.id = PRIMARY_MI2S_RX,
+			.codec_sysclk_set = true,
+			.mi2s_mclk_enable = true,
+			.mi2s_bclk_enable = true,
+		}, {
+			.id = QUATERNARY_MI2S_RX,
+			.codec_sysclk_set = true,
+			.mi2s_mclk_enable = true,
+			.mi2s_bclk_enable = true,
+			.jack_setup = SC8280XP_JACK_SETUP_CODEC,
+		}, {
+			.id = QUATERNARY_MI2S_TX,
+			.codec_sysclk_set = true,
+			.mi2s_mclk_enable = true,
+			.mi2s_bclk_enable = true,
+		}
+	),
 };
 
 static const struct qcom_snd_soc_common hawi_priv_data = {
